 a concrete deliverable and prerequisite skill.", "must_mention": [], "reason": "The requester needs actionable progression from data access and annotation through modeling, validation, prevalence estimation, and reporting.", "search_leads": ["clinical NLP research workflow skills SQL Python annotation validation"]}], "parse_error": false}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1225, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 2619}}
